// Aetherfall core content: resource nodes placed by the map generator.
// Shared framework authored by the lead designer; factions pick from it.
// Schema: crates/af_data/src/schema.rs. Design notes: docs/design/game-design.md.
// Keep ids stable: engine code and faction files reference them.
//
// Amounts are sized to the map generator's counts (docs/design/game-design.md 4.2 and the
// pacing model in 4.5): each start gets 6-8 berry bushes (about 2100 food, enough to reach
// the Banner Age before farming), 2-3 stone outcrops (the only stone on the map), 2-3 copper,
// iron and quartz-sand deposits, and 3 aether crystals toward the crater.
